// IRIX
// Inspired by the SGI IRIX / Indigo Magic Desktop (1988-2006)
// Bold slate blue-purple workstation aesthetic with signature teal accents
// Primary accent: Teal #00A896, Secondary accent: Gold #D0A040 for automation
// Professional workstation feel with subtle 3D knobs
// Author: Claude

